From 2349ec2ada9e0144b2565c2f376a9af0f3ca2dec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nirmal Raj S <nirm@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 11:49:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix MLD group locking and add UCI wifi-mld ifname lookup

Consolidate per-function file locking in MLD group helpers into a
single exclusive lock on /var/lock/prplmesh-mld-grp.lock held for
the entire read-check-write sequence in get_ifname_wrt_mld_grp(),
making it safe for concurrent radio processes.

Add bpl_cfg_get_mld_ifname_by_ssid() (UCI impl + Linux stub) to
look up the ifname from a wifi-mld section by SSID, skipping STA
interfaces. Use it in get_ifname_wrt_mld_grp() to prefer the
UCI-configured ifname over the auto-generated one when registering
a new MLD group entry.

In update_vap_credentials(), introduce a prpl_config_update flag
to skip the redundant prplmesh config file update when UCI has
already set the hostap_iface option.

In add_mld_link(), always derive conf_path with the new_iface
suffix, move create_new_hostapd_conf_file() before add_interface(),
drop the DISABLE command before REMOVE, and call
remove_vap_interface() for non-primary interfaces.

Increase WPA_CTRL_READ_RETRY_MAX from 3 to 10

Signed-off-by: Nirmal Raj S <nirm@qti.qualcomm.com>
